{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1220,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A lot of people would say you have got reason\nmore than most to hate sharks and yet you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4960,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don’t."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6970,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you explain it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10290,
    "dDurationMs": 6770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It was in a spear fishing championship\nthat I was the reigning champion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17060,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was a six hour competition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20810,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After four hours many fish had been speared\nand each one had bled into the water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26890,
    "dDurationMs": 3399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The tide had gone out, but nobody had seen\nany sharks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30289,
    "dDurationMs": 6911,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I went out a bit wider and deeper to try\nand find fish that hadn't been scared."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37200,
    "dDurationMs": 6920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as I dived down I was just about to spear\na fish when this thump and crash hit me in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44120,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the chest, knocked the gun out of my hand,\nthe mask off my face."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48140,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was held through the water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51500,
    "dDurationMs": 3790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then I realized it had to be a shark."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55290,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I felt: What can I do to protect myself?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58200,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I gouged the shark’s head over with my\nfingers trying to get its eyes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63320,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seemed to let go and as it..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65670,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I fell away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66760,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I pushed at that shark to try and push it\naway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69700,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But my hand went right in his mouth, ripping."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72620,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I ended up with only one tendon left and 94\nstitches in my hand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77210,
    "dDurationMs": 6520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I grabbed the shark around the belly and\nstill 30, 40 feet under water holding on and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83730,
    "dDurationMs": 6090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then I realized air, because I was snorkeling\nand I was going to drown."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89820,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I pushed up to the surface."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92700,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And on the surface I yelled out: Shark, shark."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95930,
    "dDurationMs": 11200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I looked down and the shark was coming\nback to attack again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107130,
    "dDurationMs": 5349,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I could see this great big head and white\nteeth coming up through the blood red water"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112479,
    "dDurationMs": 4801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I thought: I have got nothing at all to\nprotect myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117280,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I kicked at the shark."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119610,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then a miracle happened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120610,
    "dDurationMs": 6270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The shark turned and swallowed the float that\nI had attached two or three fish to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126880,
    "dDurationMs": 5170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It dived and as it dived it dragged me under\nwater and it..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132050,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am on the rope."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134010,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as it dragged down I tried to find my\nbelt to get rid of it, but I couldn’t find"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138590,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139590,
    "dDurationMs": 1330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I couldn’t find the catch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140920,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I hadn't breathed... deep breathed much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142890,
    "dDurationMs": 5679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was just about to gasp water and drown\nwhen another miracle happened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148569,
    "dDurationMs": 3021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The line broke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151590,
    "dDurationMs": 5610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was severed when the shark bit me around\nthe chest and it managed to break."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157200,
    "dDurationMs": 5470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As I came up to the surface yelling out: Shark,\nshark, shark, a boat actually had seen the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162670,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bright red water, my blood, and was coming\nover to investigate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167770,
    "dDurationMs": 6290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They quickly picked me up, rolled me into\nthe boat and with really great precision I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174060,
    "dDurationMs": 6970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was in a hospital within an hour given blood\nand luckily stitched up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181030,
    "dDurationMs": 6580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The photographs that were taken on the operating\ntable and my stories went around the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187610,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People wondered whether I would go back in\nthe water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191360,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was when I was at the Adelaide Zoo looking\nat the lion cages that I came up with the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196440,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197440,
    "dDurationMs": 1519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will make a cage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198959,
    "dDurationMs": 5441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will lower it over the side of the boat\nin an area where these great big great white"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204400,
    "dDurationMs": 5430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sharks habit and I will have a look for myself\nto see if I want to go diving again, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209830,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I loved diving, but I was really scared."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213740,
    "dDurationMs": 6540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We made the first cage and on that first expedition,\nyou know, 48 years ago, we made the first"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220280,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "great white shark films ever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222490,
    "dDurationMs": 5619,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e That firs time that you put the cage in\nthe water, did that cure your fear?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228109,
    "dDurationMs": 1401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Not really at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229510,
    "dDurationMs": 1259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It helped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230769,
    "dDurationMs": 6621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first shark that came really looked like\na small submarine with a deadly front on it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237390,
    "dDurationMs": 2679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a torpedo to the teeth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240069,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We thought maybe the sharks were interested\nin the people inside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243629,
    "dDurationMs": 5161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then we found that they would come up\nan bite on the cage even when there was no"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248790,
    "dDurationMs": 4750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one in it and what we ended up finding it\nwas the electrolysis that was sent out by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253540,
    "dDurationMs": 4759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the salt water on the seal that attracted\nthem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258299,
    "dDurationMs": 3291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And so now that you spend so much time\nwith sharks, I mean, how do you feel about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261590,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "them?\u003e\u003e"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262590,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are a wonderful, interesting animal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265370,
    "dDurationMs": 6090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And even today they still need help, because\npeople still fear and dread them because they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271460,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are the last major predator that will eat\nyou."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275370,
    "dDurationMs": 7070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But with education, it think people will understand\nthat we need them in our oceans and of 400"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282440,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "varieties, there is only a handful that may\nbite people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287440,
    "dDurationMs": 8390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The more I got interested in sharks and the\nmore I loved the sea, I was able to return"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295830,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and go abalone diving all around... along\nour coastline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300090,
    "dDurationMs": 8820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I spent 16 years and 5000 hours or more underwater\nand on those occasions I only saw three sharks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308910,
    "dDurationMs": 4450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Normally they don’t have humans on their\nmenu list."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313360,
    "dDurationMs": 2089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They prefer to stick to their own food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315449,
    "dDurationMs": 4422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank goodness they didn’t, because along\nour beaches they could ... there would be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319871,
    "dDurationMs": 4599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a real smorgasbord if they wanted to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324470,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e A lot of people would say you have got\nreason, more than most, to hate sharks and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327930,
    "dDurationMs": 2299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yet you don’t."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330229,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you explain it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331229,
    "dDurationMs": 9720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It is the anomaly of this fear that was\ngenerated and shown to me after my shark attack"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340949,
    "dDurationMs": 2071,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "made me think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343020,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Going back into the water was a real relief\nand I found it wasn’t as bad as everybody"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349860,
    "dDurationMs": 1119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thought."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350979,
    "dDurationMs": 5541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I spent the whole of my life trying to\nput sharks in a different perspective."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356520,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Because of that experience you had."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358170,
    "dDurationMs": 690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Because of my experience, yes."
    } ]
  } ]
}
